00:10:08.475 --> 00:10:11.211
It's really best to drink less.

00:10:11.211 --> 00:10:13.713
How to make black fungus, red dates, and ginger soup

00:10:13.713 --> 00:10:15.882
1-2 fresh black fungus

00:10:15.882 --> 00:10:17.250
6 slices of old ginger

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.751
15 red dates

00:10:18.751 --> 00:10:20.720
1200cc of water

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.922
Make two cuts on the red dates with a knife.

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:25.725
Add all the ingredients: black fungus, old ginger, etc.

00:10:25.725 --> 00:10:27.861
Place in the inner pot of the electric rice cooker

00:10:27.861 --> 00:10:30.330
Add 1200cc of water

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:31.931
Add 1.5 cups of water

00:10:31.931 --> 00:10:33.466
to the outer pot of the electric rice cooker.

00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:35.235
Press the switch to cook

00:10:35.235 --> 00:10:37.003
After the switch pops up

00:10:37.003 --> 00:10:38.671
can enjoy it directly.

00:10:38.671 --> 00:10:40.406
Alternatively,

00:10:40.406 --> 00:10:41.708
remove the ginger slices

00:10:41.708 --> 00:10:43.209
and put the ingredients from the pot into a blender.

00:10:43.209 --> 00:10:44.978
Blend until thick.

00:10:44.978 --> 00:10:46.379
can drink it.

00:10:46.379 --> 00:10:48.047
People who want something sweeter

00:10:48.047 --> 00:10:51.017
You can add an appropriate amount of sugar.

